WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.000
The old model. Officials behind a screen, waiting for instructions.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:16.000
The new command. People active, integrating their knowledge into the solution, coordinating resources from the command post.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:26.000
GusCoordina brings institutions together in real time. Six specialized agents per incident, reports and permanent traceability.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:35.000
Everyone is notified instantly. Information is processed and articulated permanently, in daily operations and in crisis.
